"B<BPF_MAP_TYPE_HASH> and B<BPF_MAP_TYPE_ARRAY> (this list could be extended "
"in the future)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
